# VLM Judge configuration (Layer 6A · vlm_judge.py)
# ==================================================
# Copy to `.env` (gitignored) and fill in. Only needed for the VLM / Hybrid
# judge paths — Human voting and the whole objective pipeline need none of this.
#
# The provider is auto-detected from VLM_BASE_URL:
#   * native Gemini    -> URL contains generativelanguage.googleapis.com (no /openai)
#   * OpenAI-compatible -> anything else (OpenRouter, Google's /openai endpoint, …)
# So switching providers is an .env edit, never a code change.

# --- OpenAI-compatible example (OpenRouter, free vision model) ---
VLM_BASE_URL=https://openrouter.ai/api/v1
VLM_MODEL=google/gemini-2.0-flash-exp:free
VLM_API_KEY=sk-your-key-here

# --- Native Gemini (AI Studio) example — uncomment to use instead ---
# VLM_BASE_URL=https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta
# VLM_MODEL=gemini-2.0-flash
# VLM_API_KEY=AIza...your-key
